            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>
          Fuel, tolls, extra miles and insurance (if you buy ours) are on top. Your quote confirms the exact collection fee before you book. For the full rate card, including the {midTier.days}-day and {weekTier.days}-day rates, see <a href="/pricing">pricing</a>. For what every Lamborghini costs, read <a href="/blog/how-much-is-a-lamborghini-rental">how much is a Lamborghini rental</a>.
        </p>

        <p>
          If one day turns into {numWord(threeTier.days)}, the {label(sto)} drops to {usd(perDayAt(sto, threeTier.days))} a day, and to {usd(perDayAt(sto, weekTier.days))} a day for {numWord(weekTier.days)} days or more.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ready to plan yours? Pick your dates in the form at the top of this page. It is already set to the {label(sto)}.
        </p>

